   6:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          functionalities of the internal FLASH memory:
   8:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Program operations functions
   9:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Memory Control functions
