  13:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### FLASH peripheral features #####
  15:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  17:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses
  18:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations
  19:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  20:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  21:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
  22:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        prefetch and cache lines.
  23:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  24:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The FLASH main features are:
  25:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  26:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
  27:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Read / write protections
  28:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Option bytes programming
  29:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Prefetch on I-Code
  30:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 32 cache lines of 4*64 bits on I-Code
ARM GAS  /var/tmp//ccfzjIcb.s 			page 2


  31:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 8 cache lines of 4*64 bits on D-Code
  32:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Error code correction (ECC) : Data in flash are 72-bits word
  33:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****           (8 bits added per double word)
  34:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  35:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  36:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  37:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****  ==============================================================================
  38:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]
  39:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       This driver provides functions and macros to configure and program the FLASH
  40:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       memory of all STM32L4xx devices.
  41:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  42:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Flash Memory IO Programming functions:
  43:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and
  44:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  45:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Program functions: double word and fast program (full row programming)
  46:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) There Two modes of programming :
  47:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Polling mode using HAL_FLASH_Program() function
  48:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Interrupt mode using HAL_FLASH_Program_IT() function
  49:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  50:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Interrupts and flags management functions :
  51:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Handle FLASH interrupts by calling HAL_FLASH_IRQHandler()
  52:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Callback functions are called when the flash operations are finished :
  53:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_EndOfOperationCallback() when everything is ok, otherwise
  54:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_OperationErrorCallback()
  55:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Get error flag status by calling HAL_GetError()
  56:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  57:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Option bytes management functions :
  58:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the option bytes using HAL_FLASH_OB_Unlock() and
  59:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_OB_Lock() functions
  60:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Launch the reload of the option bytes using HAL_FLASH_Launch() function.
  61:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 In this case, a reset is generated
  62:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  63:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]
  64:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       In addition to these functions, this driver includes a set of macros allowing
  65:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****       to handle the following operations:
  66:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Set the latency
  67:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the prefetch buffer
  68:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  69:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Reset the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  70:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Flash power-down during low-power run and sleep modes
  71:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Flash interrupts
  72:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Monitor the Flash flags status
  73:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  74:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash.c ****  @endverbatim
